  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced responsible business conduct for decent work in the private sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO programme in Qatar has a broad agenda on the issue of the protection of rights. The programme will work to promote responsible business conduct, with the Qatar Chamber of Commerce &amp; Industry (QCCI) and Ministry of Labour (MOL), but also through partnerships with Qatar University , Qatar Financial Center (QFC) and other partners.</narrative>
  </description>
